{
 "name": "himars",
 "note": "M142 HIMARS on FMTV 6x6. Scale 1 m = 16 px. Real 7.0 x 2.4 x 3.2 m; drawn 112 x 38 x 52 px, wheels 22 px (stylised up from 1.15 m). Identifiers: armoured cab-over with flat split windshield and small door windows, front axle far from the rear tandem, launcher module on a turntable at the rear with one big six-tube pod, pod caps on the rear face, crane boom on the pod roof, sand CARC. Mod contract: bones cab, turret>rack, steer_0r/l>wheel_0r/l, wheel_1*, wheel_2*, jack0/1.",
